# The corpus is derived data: ~1000 PR directories holding raw diffs, several hundred MB.
# It is rebuilt deterministically by `study clone && study collect` (seeded sampling), so
# committing it would bloat the repo to reproduce something a command already reproduces.
#
# What SHOULD be published alongside a writeup is the per-PR scores CSV and the report, not
# the diffs. Copy those out of data/out/ and commit them deliberately.
data/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
